hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"376","Jarir reported that the Prophet"
"377","Anas ibn Malik said"
"378","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"379","'You did not feed it nor give it water\nwhen you imprisoned it nor did you release it and let it eat from the plants\nof the earth."""""""""
"380","'Abdullah ibn al-'As reported that the Prophet"
"381","Abu Umama that the Messenger of Allah"
"382","'Abdullah reported that the Prophet"
"383","Hisham ibn 'Urwa reported that Ibn az-Zubayr was in Makka and the\nCompanions of the Prophet"
"384","Anas said"
"385","Umm Kulthum"
"386","'Abdullah reported that the Prophet"
